    "detailed_description": "The demon king has risen from beyond the realm, heralding the end of humanity. In a post-yokai apocalypse, only demon hunters stand between the demon king's army and whats left of humanity.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDemon legend is a fast paced, action platformer metroidvania with dynamic player swapping action and a cast of varied characters. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nControl several demon hunters and swap between them at will, chaining abilities together.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHunt down yokai for coin and profit. Upgrade your arsenal in merchant shops and purchase new abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHelp defend humanity's last villages from large yokai bosses that serve the demon king.",
